<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>RecSandbox</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@500;600;700&family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  box-sizing:border-box;
  padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);
  padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
  --orange:#ff7a1a;--orange-dark:#e8620a;--pale:#f3c9a6;--cream:#fff4ec;
  --ink:#333333;--card:#ffffff;--muted:#6b5f57;--teal:#1fa6a0;--bg:#fff9f4;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){
  --ink:#f6ede6;--card:#2c2420;--muted:#c4b4a8;--cream:#382c25;--bg:#1f1814;--pale:#6b4a33;}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--ink:#f6ede6;--card:#2c2420;--muted:#c4b4a8;--cream:#382c25;--bg:#1f1814;--pale:#6b4a33;}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);scroll-behavior:smooth}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:400 17px/1.6 Nunito,system-ui,sans-serif}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:Fredoka,"Trebuchet MS",sans-serif;line-height:1.15;margin:0}
a{color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--teal);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:8px}
.wrap{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}
nav{position:sticky;top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);z-index:5;background:var(--card);border-bottom:2px solid var(--pale)}
nav .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;height:60px}
nav .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font:700 22px Fredoka,sans-serif;text-decoration:none;margin-right:auto}
nav .brand img{height:36px;width:auto}
nav a.l{text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted)}
nav a.l:hover{color:var(--orange-dark)}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--orange);color:#fff;font:600 19px Fredoka,sans-serif;padding:12px 28px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;border:0;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 4px 0 var(--orange-dark)}
.btn:active{transform:translateY(3px);box-shadow:0 1px 0 var(--orange-dark)}
.btn.alt{background:var(--card);color:var(--orange-dark);box-shadow:0 4px 0 var(--pale);border:2px solid var(--pale)}
.hero{background:var(--orange);color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:32px;align-items:center;padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:64px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,68px);font-weight:700}
.hero p{font-size:20px;max-width:34ch;margin:16px 0 28px}
.hero .btns{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero .btn{background:#fff;color:var(--orange-dark);box-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.2)}
.hero .btn.alt{background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);box-shadow:none}
.card-login{background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);border-radius:28px;padding:28px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.18)}
.card-login img{width:120px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto 12px}
.card-login .fake{display:block;margin:10px 0;padding:14px;border-radius:14px;font:600 19px Fredoka,sans-serif}
.fake.play{background:var(--orange);color:#fff}
.fake.sw{border:2px solid var(--pale);color:var(--orange-dark)}
.fake.lang{color:var(--muted);font-size:16px}
.silhouette{position:absolute;left:-60px;bottom:-40px;width:260px;opacity:.16;pointer-events:none}
section{padding:64px 0}
section h2{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,42px);margin-bottom:8px}
.lede{color:var(--muted);max-width:56ch;margin:0 0 32px}
.rooms{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:20px}
.room{background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--pale);border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden}
.room svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;background:var(--cream)}
.room div{padding:16px 18px 20px}
.room h3{font-size:22px;margin-bottom:6px}
.room p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:16px}
.band{background:var(--cream)}
.feat{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:28px 36px}
.feat h3{font-size:21px;margin-bottom:4px;color:var(--orange-dark)}
.feat p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
.ctrl{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:var(--card);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden}
.wide{overflow-x:auto;border-radius:18px;border:2px solid var(--pale)}
.ctrl th,.ctrl td{padding:12px 16px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--pale);vertical-align:top}
.ctrl th{font:600 18px Fredoka,sans-serif;background:var(--cream)}
.ctrl tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}
kbd{background:var(--cream);border:2px solid var(--pale);border-radius:8px;padding:1px 8px;font:700 14px Nunito,sans-serif;white-space:nowrap}
.dl{background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--pale);border-radius:28px;padding:32px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:24px;align-items:center}
.dl p{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}
footer{background:var(--ink);color:#f6ede6;padding:40px 0 48px;font-size:15px}
:root:not([data-theme="dark"]) footer{background:#2f2621}
footer p{margin:0 0 10px;max-width:70ch;color:#d9cbc0}
footer strong{color:#fff}
@media (max-width:760px){
  .hero .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .silhouette{display:none}
  .dl{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  nav a.l{display:none}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}.btn:active{transform:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="#top"><img alt="" src="data:image/png;base64,">RecSandbox</a>
    <a class="l" href="#places">Places</a>
    <a class="l" href="#make">Make things</a>
    <a class="l" href="#controls">Controls</a>
    <a class="btn" href="#play" style="padding:8px 20px;font-size:17px">Play</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="top">
  <svg class="silhouette" viewBox="0 0 100 130" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="50" cy="30" r="26" fill="#000"/><rect x="14" y="52" width="72" height="80" rx="34" fill="#000"/></svg>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <h1>Hang out, build stuff, crash cars.</h1>
      <p>RecSandbox is a free fan-made social game inspired by Rec Room. Play on a flat screen or in VR.</p>
      <div class="btns">
        <a class="btn" href="#play">Get the game</a>
        <a class="btn alt" href="#places">Look around</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-login" aria-hidden="true">
      <img alt="" src="data:image/png;base64,">
      <span class="fake play">PLAY</span>
      <span class="fake sw">SWITCH ACCOUNT</span>
      <span class="fake lang">Language</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="places">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Places to go</h2>
    <p class="lede">You spawn in your dorm. Open your watch, press Play, and head out.</p>
    <div class="rooms">
      <article class="room">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 240 150" role="img" aria-label="Drawing of the dorm: loft with a desk, bed below, mirror and door">
          <rect width="240" height="150" fill="#fff4ec"/>
          <rect x="20" y="20" width="200" height="110" fill="none" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
          <path d="M20 62h110v8H20z" fill="#f3c9a6" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
          <rect x="34" y="44" width="40" height="6" fill="#333"/><rect x="38" y="50" width="4" height="12" fill="#333"/><rect x="66" y="50" width="4" height="12" fill="#333"/>
          <path d="M118 62v68M126 62v68M118 78h8M118 94h8M118 110h8" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
          <rect x="34" y="106" width="70" height="18" rx="4" fill="#1fa6a0" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
          <rect x="190" y="36" width="22" height="70" rx="4" fill="#cfeff0" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
          <rect x="60" y="28" width="26" height="22" fill="#fff" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="140" y="28" width="26" height="22" fill="#fff" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
        </svg>
        <div><h3>The dorm</h3><p>A loft with a desk and ladder, a bed, windows, and a mirror that really shows your reflection.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="room">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 240 150" role="img" aria-label="Drawing of the Rec Center hall with a sign and three tiers">
          <rect width="240" height="150" fill="#fff4ec"/>
          <rect x="30" y="14" width="180" height="26" rx="6" fill="#ff7a1a" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
          <text x="120" y="33" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Fredoka,sans-serif" font-weight="700" font-size="16" fill="#fff">Rec SandBox</text>
          <rect x="30" y="52" width="180" height="16" fill="#f3c9a6" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
          <rect x="30" y="78" width="180" height="16" fill="#f3c9a6" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
          <rect x="30" y="104" width="180" height="16" fill="#f3c9a6" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
          <path d="M30 120l-14 20h30" fill="none" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
          <rect x="176" y="92" width="34" height="48" fill="#1fa6a0" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
        </svg>
        <div><h3>The Rec Center</h3><p>The main hall with the big sign, three tiers, an upstairs with stairs, and a door to the cafeteria.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="room">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 240 150" role="img" aria-label="Drawing of the cafeteria with a food machine and two tables">
          <rect width="240" height="150" fill="#fff4ec"/>
          <rect x="88" y="14" width="64" height="62" rx="8" fill="#e8620a" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
          <rect x="100" y="26" width="40" height="26" fill="#fff" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
          <rect x="30" y="100" width="64" height="12" rx="4" fill="#f3c9a6" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M40 112v22M84 112v22" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
          <rect x="146" y="100" width="64" height="12" rx="4" fill="#f3c9a6" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M156 112v22M200 112v22" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
          <circle cx="178" cy="84" r="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
        </svg>
        <div><h3>The cafeteria</h3><p>Grab food from the machine, pull up a chair, and sit with friends.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="room">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 240 150" role="img" aria-label="Drawing of the Crash Zone with a ramp and a car">
          <rect width="240" height="150" fill="#fff4ec"/>
          <path d="M10 124h220" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
          <path d="M120 124l60-40v40z" fill="#f3c9a6" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
          <rect x="30" y="96" width="70" height="20" rx="8" fill="#ff7a1a" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
          <circle cx="48" cy="120" r="9" fill="#333"/><circle cx="84" cy="120" r="9" fill="#333"/>
          <rect x="196" y="100" width="22" height="24" fill="#1fa6a0" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3"/>
        </svg>
        <div><h3>Crash Zone</h3><p>A big playground of ramps, crates, and barrels. Smash through it and watch your car dent.</p></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="make">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Make it yours</h2>
    <p class="lede">Build rooms, dress your player, and play together.</p>
    <div class="feat">
      <div><h3>Maker Pen</h3><p>Open your backpack and place cubes, balls, ramps, pizza, burgers, and more. Your creations are saved in each room.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Customize your player</h3><p>Pick your skin, shirt, pants, and hat. Your look is saved with your account.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Flat screen or VR</h3><p>Play with a keyboard and mouse, or put on a headset and use your hands. In VR your avatar follows your head and controllers.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Your watch</h3><p>Press Y to open your watch. Check your profile, press Play to travel, or open your Backpack.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Real car damage</h3><p>Hits slow you down, pull you to one side, and knock parts off. Press F to repair.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Accounts that stay</h3><p>Create an account once and stay signed in. Your look and creations are waiting next time.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="controls">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Controls</h2>
    <p class="lede">Everything you need on day one.</p>
    <div class="wide"><table class="ctrl">
      <thead><tr><th>Action</th><th>Flat screen</th><th>VR</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Move and jump</td><td><kbd>W</kbd> <kbd>A</kbd> <kbd>S</kbd> <kbd>D</kbd> and <kbd>Space</kbd></td><td>Left stick walk, right stick snap-turn</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Open the watch</td><td><kbd>Y</kbd></td><td>Left controller Y button</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Maker Pen</td><td>Click to place, right-click to delete, <kbd>R</kbd> to rotate, wheel to resize</td><td>Right trigger place, A delete, B rotate, right stick resize</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Drive in Crash Zone</td><td><kbd>W</kbd>/<kbd>S</kbd> gas and brake, <kbd>A</kbd>/<kbd>D</kbd> steer, <kbd>Space</kbd> drift</td><td>Right trigger gas, left trigger brake, left stick steer</td></tr>
        <tr><td>See yourself</td><td><kbd>V</kbd> for selfie view, or <kbd>E</kbd> at the mirror</td><td>Look in the dorm mirror</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="play">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="dl">
      <div>
        <h2>Get RecSandbox</h2>
        <p>Free fan game made in Godot 4.3+. Open the project, press F5, and create an account. For VR, start SteamVR or Oculus before you launch.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn" href="#" aria-disabled="true">Download soon</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p><strong>RecSandbox™</strong> &copy; 2026 AD (Austin DeHart). All rights reserved. The RecSandbox logo is original artwork and may not be copied or used in other projects without permission.</p>
    <p>RecSandbox is an unofficial fan game. It is not made by, affiliated with, or endorsed by Rec Room Inc. Rec Room and Rec.net belong to their owners.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
